description	"The Technician

Tech support units are tasked with providing allies with much needed health and ammunition when necessary. They can deploy sentry droids and seeker drones to supplement their own lack of firepower, as well as utilize pulse grenades to deal with certain annoying droid classes. On top of all of this, they are excellent hackers. They are, however, very poor fighters. 

^2Weaponry:
- DEMP 2 (3)
-- 2 Ion Blasts
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- 2 Pulse Grenades
- Wrench
-- ^3Yellow ^7Style Only

^6Equipment: 
- Electrobinoculars
- Seeker Drone
- Portable Sentry
- Portable E-Web Blaster Cannon

^8Attributes:
- Can See HP/Armor Stats of Allies
- Close-Combat Training (2)
- 2 Reinforcements (CTF: 10s Respawn)
- Assemble (1) - Respawns on characters with Rally

^3Abilities:
- Ammunition Supplies [Press Use to Drop Ammo]
- Armor Regeneration Supplies [Hold Use on Allies]

^2Strengths^7: Excellent support units, with health, ammo, and other supplies.
^1Weaknesses^7: Inferior in direct combat role"